{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"contentTxt\"><p>【Now新聞台】18歲港將馬嘉言在IBF保齡球世界盃男子個人賽奪冠。</p></div>\n<div class=\"contentTxt\"><p>IBF保齡球世界盃男子個人賽周日在德國慕尼黑舉行，比賽採用三局兩勝制，馬嘉言分別以202比201及203比198，於決賽首兩局擊敗法國籍對手，是繼另一名港將胡兆康2015年在美國世界盃賽事封王後，第二位在世界盃賽事封王的香港球手。</p></div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T02:39:04.345074+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T02:33:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T02:57:34.511003+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T02:37:34.415782+00:00","content_hash":"933998d0366802e1d1b35d33f4d178cce506b3a069883a2c369e32eef649b90e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}